00:37:20.580 --> 00:37:20.930
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:37:20.930 --> 00:37:21.180
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yep.

00:37:21.180 --> 00:37:22.120
MARK MANDEL: Yep.

